{"review_id": "6208972e-96ee-4568-9a8d-04082b5a4ccf", "package": "com.gohary.habitradar", "app_name": "Habit Tracker - Habit Radar", "language": "fr", "language_name": "French", "rating": 4, "text": "The app is beautiful and good, but there are some features I was hoping for more of. For example, I wish I could choose other colors, and I also wanted more icons. However, getting those options requires payment, meaning the user won't fully enjoy the app, which is unfortunate. Aside from that, I liked the app; it's beautiful.", "author": "Ikram Download", "date": "2025-12-07T17:59:40Z", "thumbs_up": 0, "app_version": "1.5.19", "developer_reply": null}
